# Text is normalised to LF IN THE REPOSITORY whatever a contributor's machine writes
# locally. Without this the repo depends on every contributor having core.autocrlf set
# the way it happens to need — which is how minecraft-server-website ended up with 36 of
# its 118 files in CRLF from its root commit onwards, and how a one-line edit there can
# produce a diff of the whole file.
* text=auto

# Never touched: line endings inside these are content, not formatting.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
